WEBVTT

39:31.687 --> 39:33.439
I'm the same as you.

39:33.564 --> 39:35.566
Yeah. Yeah, I...

39:35.691 --> 39:37.401
I find that hard to believe.

39:37.526 --> 39:40.029
I came very close once.

39:40.154 --> 39:43.240
I was alone in a room
with a naked girl, but...

39:44.283 --> 39:47.620
- Didn't know where to put it?
- I know where to put it.

39:48.204 --> 39:49.580
Was she...

39:49.705 --> 39:51.791
old and ugly?

